    "description": "A very small, slow-growing deciduous shrub eventually reaching 1m or more in height, with tiny rich green, palmate, 5-lobed leaves 2-3cm long and wide, the new spring leaves yellow green, margined red, turning shades of yellow and orange in autumn; ideal for bonsai training",
